</div><div id="shopify-section-template--25807570207048__db_accordion_image_UDAFdA" class="shopify-section">

<div class="db-accordin-section">
  <div class="db-accordion-image">
    <div class="db-accordion-image__box">

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="db-accordion-image__content">
        
          <h2 class="db-accordion-image__title">
            FAQ's
          </h2>
        

        <div class="db-accordion">
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                What is Square Golf Home best suited for?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Square Golf Home is designed specifically for indoor golf practice and simulation. It is ideal for home simulator setups with controlled space and consistent lighting, delivering reliable ball and club data for practice, play, and coaching.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                What is Square Golf Omni?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Square Golf Omni is an indoor and outdoor launch monitor that combines high-speed camera technology with advanced shot analysis. It is built for golfers who want the flexibility to practise at home, in a simulator bay, or outdoors at the range.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                Does Square Golf Home work with simulator software?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Yes. Square Golf Home integrates seamlessly with Square Golf’s simulator and practice software, allowing users to play virtual courses, run skills challenges, and analyse detailed shot data from a single system.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                Can Square Golf Omni be used outdoors?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Yes. Square Golf Omni is specifically engineered for both indoor and outdoor use, making it suitable for driving ranges, coaching sessions, and backyard practice, as well as full simulator environments.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                Do I need special golf balls to use Square Golf Home Edition?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Square Golf Home uses camera-based tracking optimised for indoor use. For best accuracy, it is recommended to follow Square Golf’s ball and setup guidance as outlined in the installation documentation.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                What data does Square Golf Omni measure?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Square Golf Omni provides comprehensive ball and club data, including launch conditions, shot shape, distance metrics, and club delivery information. This makes it suitable for performance improvement, coaching, and serious practice.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                What customer support is available in the UK and Europe?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>Square Golf provides dedicated customer support for the UK and European markets. Our local support team is available to assist with product setup, software access, and general enquiries. For more advanced or technical issues, cases are escalated directly to the Square Golf headquarters technical team, ensuring expert-level support and efficient resolution.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div
              class="db-accordion__item"
              
            >
              <button
                class="db-accordion__question"
                type="button"
              >
                How are Square Golf products delivered in the UK and Europe?
                <span class="db-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </button>

              <div class="db-accordion__answer">
                <p>All Square Golf products are shipped using FedEx Express, a fast and fully tracked delivery service. This ensures secure, reliable, and timely delivery across the UK and Europe, with tracking provided as soon as your order is dispatched.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Button -->
        <div class="db-accordion-image__cta">
          <a href="/pages/contact#shopify-section-template--25807570272584__collapsible_content_T9WrTG" class="db-accordion-image__button">
            Do you have more questions?
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="db-accordion-image__media">
        
          <img
            src="//squaregolf.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/Square_Golf_Indoor_Sim_Room.jpg?v=1769695916&width=800"
            alt=""
            loading="lazy"
          >
        
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>




